<title>UK: Wuestenrot Hypo sets 250 mln mark four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Wuestenrot Hypo sets 250 mln mark four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BW Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUESTENROT HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY    30.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.125   PAY DATE    30.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+=</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR YEARS 1 AND 2, 5.0 PCT YEARS 3 AND 4, 6.0 PCT</p>
<p>YEARS 5 AND 6, 7.0 PCT YEARS 7 AND 8, 9.0 PCT YEAR</p>
<p>		NINE AND 10.0 PCT YEAR 10</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    STUT	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
